    "source": "\n**Location:** `curt-home-office`\n\n**Frame:** Close on Curt’s face lit unevenly by the screen, then on a report passage describing an experiment that might permanently end a run. His expression is incredulous, not horrified spectacle.\n\n**Dialogue — CURT:**\n> Oh, come on.\n\n**Provenance:** `reconstructed` — creator dialogue is freely reconstructed.\n\n",
